    Add bare frontmatter, --meta filtering, virtual dirs, merged envelope
    
    Phases 0-3 of indexnudge enhancement spec:
    - Phase 0: config plumbing (bare_frontmatter, virtual_directories options)
    - Phase 1: bare front matter support (title: detection, round-trip writer)
    - Phase 2: --meta key=value filtering on find
    - Phase 3: virtual directory nodes (_prefix auto-generated indices)
    - Merged retrieve envelope (front matter fields in document: block)
    
    5-model adversarial audit (gpt-4.1, gpt-5.2, gpt-5.3-codex,
    claude-sonnet-4, claude-opus-4.6). 2 HIGH findings fixed:
    - F1: to_file_name unconditional _ stripping (now config-gated)
    - F2: duplicate title in envelope (reserved key filter)
    
    All 900+ tests pass.
    
